# Exclude the root-level api/ Vercel serverless functions (gateway, risk,
# evidence, docs-gen, egress — see api/*/[...path].{ts,py}) from the docs
# project's build; the docs project doesn't need them.
#
# Leading slash anchors this pattern to the repo root (this file's
# directory), not to every "api" directory found deeper in the tree.
#
# NOTE: an earlier version of this comment referenced a "dashboard-saas"
# directory and a "dashboard-api" Vercel project; neither exists in this
# repo (verified at HEAD). The full multi-project Vercel deploy topology
# isn't captured anywhere in this repo — there is no vercel.json checked in.
/api/
